{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Halcyon 是一款以 GTD 流程為核心的任務管理應用，適合重視資料自主、希望待辦清單留在自己手中的使用者。所有清單以純文字 Markdown 檔案存放於 iCloud Drive，即使日後停用程式，內容依然完整可讀。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-260.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>純文字檔案管理任務清單</h2>\n<p>任務清單以純文字 Markdown 檔案存放於自己的 iCloud Drive，可隨時在其他編輯器開啟修改，離線亦能使用。透過小工具、分享表單或 Siri 快速記錄，內容先進入收件匣，再整理成專案、子任務與情境標籤。程式提供今日、即將到期與每週回顧檢視，並可交由 AI 助理批次整理，無需帳號與訂閱。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-264-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-265-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-266-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-267-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-268-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Halcyon:GTD</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/halcyon-gtd/id6833943756?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T22:04:21.804034+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T21:42:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:17:35.584761+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T21:57:51.528169+00:00","content_hash":"45055b543b4df9376927dac6e4e5b806d36a3692da571a37988db66472089ed4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}